{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story - interactive game set in ancient times. Players will experience beautiful love stories in an ancient - themed world and achieve perfect endings by making choices within the plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433810/extras/81eabb403cbc704d2b18e4df664d872e.poster.avif?t=1749807689\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433810/extras/81eabb403cbc704d2b18e4df664d872e.webm?t=1749807689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433810/extras/81eabb403cbc704d2b18e4df664d872e.mp4?t=1749807689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, accompanied by various female characters and dozens of other characters, players will embark on a thrilling and eventful journey. You can make decisions about key plot actions, which will lead to different outcomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the gameplay, you can also savor the joy of exploration and discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433810/extras/5e7369ad676266ba8f0e56d498834560.poster.avif?t=1749807689\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433810/extras/5e7369ad676266ba8f0e56d498834560.webm?t=1749807689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433810/extras/5e7369ad676266ba8f0e56d498834560.mp4?t=1749807689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are numerous plot - decision points in the story, which will determine different fates for the male and female protagonists. With up to a hundred plot options, multiple storylines, and various endings, you can dig deep to uncover the secrets hidden behind the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was shot by a large - scale live - action team, and it is exquisitely produced. We hope you'll enjoy this story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can experience a life of luxury and dissipation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can pretend to be weak and then surprise others with your true strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can save those around you...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is the glamorous nightlife, as well as the simple life in the marketplace; there are acts of righting wrongs, as well as deeds of serving the country and the people; there is the pursuit of dreams, as well as the encounter with well - matched opponents...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is waiting for you to open it, waiting for you to explore it, and waiting for you to change it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to join our Discord channel, the channel link is on the store page.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ chat group\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.5: 1034091533</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.7\uff1a691413944</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.8: 1029135802</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No.6: 338088696\uff08<strong>full</strong>\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No.4: 1033878474\uff08<strong>full</strong>\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MATURE CONTENT DESCRIPTION</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2